{"uid":"64c1191a513c8917","name":"test_generic_schema_site_repair_counts_the_re_entry_once","fullName":"tests.test_worker_hat#test_generic_schema_site_repair_counts_the_re_entry_once","historyId":"7b6e468ab9483565934bfdefd6d0ddcb","time":{"start":1792071801781,"stop":1792071801872,"duration":91},"description":"Requirement B.2 (#128), the letter of the criterion: after\n    `enforcement.ok` at the GENERIC schema site (`elif schema_errors:`,\n    reached only when `verdict` matches none of the known enum branches --\n    unlike the sibling test above, which never leaves the `\"complete\"`\n    branch's own pre-existing ladder), the dispatch is re-entered with the\n    repaired payload EXACTLY once, counted directly on `sup._last_worker_\n    dispatch_reentries` -- never merely inferred from the task having\n    moved (that inference is `test_a_malformed_complete_report_is_repaired_\n    by_one_uncharged_re_ask`'s job, and it exercises a different ladder).\n    The first payload's `verdict: \"done\"` is not a member of the enum at\n    all, so it fails schema validation and matches none of `\"unsatisfiable\"`/\n    `\"complete\"`/`\"plan_complete\"` -- landing in `elif schema_errors:`,\n    task 008's own site -- where the re-ask ladder repairs it into a valid\n    `\"complete\"` report, re-dispatched once into the branch that owns it.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Requirement B.2 (#128), the letter of the criterion: after<br />\n<code>enforcement.ok</code> at the GENERIC schema site (<code>elif schema_errors:</code>,<br />\nreached only when <code>verdict</code> matches none of the known enum branches --<br />\nunlike the sibling test above, which never leaves the <code>&quot;complete&quot;</code><br />\nbranch's own pre-existing ladder), the dispatch is re-entered with the<br />\nrepaired payload EXACTLY once, counted directly on <code>sup._last_worker_ dispatch_reentries</code> -- never merely inferred from the task having<br />\nmoved (that inference is <code>test_a_malformed_complete_report_is_repaired_ by_one_uncharged_re_ask</code>'s job, and it exercises a different ladder).<br />\nThe first payload's <code>verdict: &quot;done&quot;</code> is not a member of the enum at<br />\nall, so it fails schema validation and matches none of <code>&quot;unsatisfiable&quot;</code>/<br />\n<code>&quot;complete&quot;</code>/<code>&quot;plan_complete&quot;</code> -- landing in <code>elif schema_errors:</code>,<br />\ntask 008's own site -- where the re-ask ladder repairs it into a valid<br />\n<code>&quot;complete&quot;</code> report, re-dispatched once into the branch that owns it.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1792071797328,"stop":1792071797328,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1792071797329,"stop":1792071797329,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1792071801770,"stop":1792071801771,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1792071801771,"stop":1792071801772,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1792071801775,"stop":1792071801778,"duration":3},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shou